#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:4
msgid "实例分割模型 (Instance Segmentation)"
msgstr "Instance Segmentation"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:7
msgid "本页面介绍DaoAI World模型的实例分割类型。返回 :ref:`DaoAI World模型主页 <DaoAI World模型>`"
msgstr ""
"This page introduces the instance segmentation types of the DaoAI World "
"model.Return :ref:`DaoAI World model homepage <DaoAI World model>`"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:10
msgid "模型简介"
msgstr "Model introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:12
msgid ""
"实例分割模型是目标检测的增强版本，不仅能识别物体并输出边界框，还能为每个物体实例生成精确的像素级分割掩码。这使得您可以获得物体的准确轮廓，而不仅仅是矩形框。"
msgstr ""
"The instance segmentation model is an enhanced version of object detection "
"that not only identifies objects and outputs bounding boxes, but also "
"generates accurate pixel-level segmentation masks for each object "
"instance.This allows you to get an accurate outline of the object, not just "
"a rectangular box."

