msgid "**自动驾驶**：车道线检测、车辆精确定位"
msgstr ""
"**Autonomous driving**: lane line detection, precise vehicle positioning"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:29
msgid "**机器人视觉**：物体抓取、障碍物规避"
msgstr "**Robot Vision**: Object grabbing, obstacle avoidance"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:30
msgid "**精确计数**：物体重叠场景的准确计数"
msgstr "**Accurate Count**: Accurate counting of objects overlapping scenes"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:31
msgid "**面积测量**：物体面积、尺寸的精确计算"
msgstr ""
"**Area Measurement**: Accurate calculation of area and size of objects"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:32
msgid "**3D重建**：物体轮廓作为3D建模的输入"
