msgid "配置示例"
msgstr "Configuration example"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:96
msgid "**基础配置**"
msgstr "**Basic configuration**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:107
msgid "**高精度场景**"
msgstr "**High precision scene**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:109
msgid "适用于需要精确分割的场景，如医学影像："
msgstr ""
"Suitable for scenes that require precise segmentation, such as medical "
"imaging:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:124
msgid "**多类别物体分割**"
msgstr "**Multi-category object segmentation**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:142
msgid "使用技巧与最佳实践"
msgstr "Tips and best practices"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:144
msgid "**掩码格式选择**"
msgstr "**Mask format selection**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:146
msgid "**Polygon（多边形）**：适合轮廓简单的物体，数据量小，易于可视化"
msgstr ""
"**Polygon**: Suitable for objects with simple outlines, small amount of "
"data, and easy to visualize"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:147
msgid "**RLE（游程编码）**：适合复杂轮廓，保留更多细节，但数据量较大"
msgstr ""
"**RLE (Run-Length Encoding)**: suitable for complex contours, retaining more"
" details, but with a larger amount of data"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:149
msgid "**置信度阈值调整**"
msgstr "**Confidence threshold adjustment**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:151
msgid "初始建议值：0.5-0.6"
msgstr "Initial recommended value: 0.5-0.6"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:152
msgid "高精度需求（如医疗）：0.8-0.9"
msgstr "High precision requirements (such as medical): 0.8-0.9"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:153
msgid "实时应用：0.5-0.7（平衡速度和精度）"
msgstr "Real-time applications: 0.5-0.7 (balance speed and accuracy)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:155
msgid "**处理遮挡场景**"
msgstr "**Handling occlusion scenes**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:157
msgid "实例分割能区分重叠物体的不同实例"
msgstr ""
"Instance segmentation can distinguish different instances of overlapping "
"objects"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:158
msgid "通过 ``instance_id`` 追踪每个独立的物体实例"
msgstr "Track each individual object instance by ``instance_id``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:159
msgid "使用 ``area`` 字段过滤部分遮挡的物体"
msgstr "Use the ``area`` field to filter partially occluded objects"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:161
msgid "**性能优化**"
msgstr "**Performance Optimization**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:163
msgid "实例分割比目标检测计算量更大"
msgstr ""
"Instance segmentation is more computationally intensive than object "
"detection"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:164
msgid "高分辨率图像建议使用GPU加速"
msgstr "GPU acceleration is recommended for high resolution images"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:165
msgid "考虑降低输入分辨率以提升速度"
msgstr "Consider lowering the input resolution to improve speed"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:167
msgid "**后处理技巧**"
msgstr "**Post-Processing Tips**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:169
msgid "对掩码进行形态学操作（膨胀、腐蚀）优化边缘"
msgstr ""
"Perform morphological operations (dilation, erosion) on masks to optimize "
"edges"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:170
msgid "使用面积阈值过滤过小的检测结果"
msgstr "Use area threshold to filter out detection results that are too small"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:171
msgid "合并相邻的同类实例（如需要）"
msgstr "Merge adjacent instances of the same type (if necessary)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:174
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "FAQ"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:176
msgid "**Q: 实例分割和语义分割有什么区别？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: What is the difference between instance segmentation and semantic "
"segmentation?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:178
#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:192
msgid "A:"
msgstr "A:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:179
msgid "**实例分割**：区分同类物体的不同实例（如3辆车会被标记为car_1, car_2, car_3）"
msgstr ""
"**Instance Segmentation**: Distinguish different instances of the same "
"object (for example, 3 cars will be marked as car_1, car_2, car_3)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:180
msgid "**语义分割**：只区分类别（如3辆车都被标记为car，不区分是哪一辆）"
msgstr ""
"**Semantic Segmentation**: Only distinguish categories (for example, 3 cars "
"are all labeled as cars, without distinguishing which one they are)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:182
msgid "**Q: 掩码的坐标系统是什么？**"
msgstr "**Q: What is the coordinate system of the mask?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:184
msgid "A: 掩码坐标与输入图像的像素坐标系统一致，左上角为原点(0,0)。"
msgstr ""
"A: The mask coordinates are consistent with the pixel coordinate system of "
"the input image, and the upper left corner is the origin (0,0)."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:186
msgid "**Q: 如何使用掩码进行抠图？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to use mask to cut out images?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:188
msgid "A: 可以将掩码作为alpha通道，或在下游节点中使用掩码区域提取对应的图像像素。"
msgstr ""
"A: You can use the mask as an alpha channel, or use the mask area in a "
"downstream node to extract the corresponding image pixels."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:190
msgid "**Q: 分割边缘不够精确怎么办？**"
msgstr ""
"**Q: What should I do if the segmentation edges are not accurate enough?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:193
msgid "提高输入图像分辨率"
msgstr "Increase input image resolution"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:194
msgid "使用更大的模型"
msgstr "Use a larger model"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:195
msgid "在训练时增加边缘质量的标注"
msgstr "Add edge quality annotation during training"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:196
msgid "后处理时使用GrabCut等算法优化边缘"
msgstr ""
"Use algorithms such as GrabCut to optimize edges during post-processing"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:198
msgid "**Q: 如何计算物体的实际尺寸？**"
msgstr "**Q: How to calculate the actual size of an object?**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:200
msgid "A: 使用 ``area`` 字段获得像素面积，然后根据相机标定参数转换为实际尺寸。"
msgstr ""
"A: Use the ``area`` field to obtain the pixel area, and then convert it to "
"the actual size according to the camera calibration parameters."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:203
msgid "应用案例"
msgstr "Application cases"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:205
msgid "**案例1：背景替换**"
msgstr "**Case 1: Background replacement**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:207
msgid "使用实例分割提取人物轮廓，实现背景替换。"
msgstr ""
"Use instance segmentation to extract character outlines and achieve "
"background replacement."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:220
msgid "工作流： 1. 使用实例分割模型提取人物掩码 2. 使用掩码将人物从原图中抠出 3. 将人物合成到新背景上"
msgstr ""
"Workflow: 1. Use the instance segmentation model to extract the character "
"mask 2. Use the mask to cut out the character from the original image 3. "
"Composite the character onto the new background"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:225
msgid "**案例2：物体计数（重叠场景）**"
msgstr "**Case 2: Object counting (overlapping scenes)**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:227
msgid "在物体重叠的场景中准确计数，如仓库中的堆叠货物。"
msgstr ""
"Accurate counting in scenes where objects overlap, such as stacked goods in "
"a warehouse."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:240
msgid "通过 ``instance_id`` 区分每个独立的物体，即使它们相互遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"Each individual object is distinguished by ``instance_id``, even if they "
"occlude each other."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:242
msgid "**案例3：精确面积测量**"
msgstr "**Case 3: Accurate area measurement**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:244
msgid "测量物体的像素面积，用于质量控制或尺寸检测。"
msgstr ""
"Measure the pixel area of ​​an object for quality control or dimensional "
"inspection."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:257
msgid "下游节点可以读取 ``area`` 字段，结合相机标定参数计算实际面积。"
msgstr ""
"Downstream nodes can read the ``area`` field and calculate the actual area "
"combined with the camera calibration parameters."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:259
msgid "**案例4：医学影像分析**"
msgstr "**Case 4: Medical Image Analysis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:261
msgid "对医学扫描图像进行器官或病灶的精确分割。"
msgstr "Precise segmentation of organs or lesions on medical scan images."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_instance_segmentation.rst:277
msgid "医疗应用需要极高的准确性，建议结合专业医生审核。"
msgstr ""
"Medical applications require extremely high accuracy, and it is recommended "
"to be reviewed by a professional doctor."

